		{
			dependencies: ["2EBB4C697D81D42A"]
			description: [
				"After obtaining the &9Secret of Rain&r, the &bSecret of Bloom&r, and the &dSecret of the Heart&r, you catch a fleeting glimpse of one of the rare &6Three World-Altering Magics&r that exist in this world."
				""
				"&6World-Altering Magic&r, as the name suggests, refers to grand-scale magic capable of reshaping entire dimensions—even worlds themselves. Unlike complex rituals, the casting of world-altering magic is more like a chain of &5coincidental events&r unfolding in perfect alignment. When everything falls into place at the right moment, the magic manifests."
				""
				"What you have now come to understand is a form known as &6Verdant Flow&r. Its activation conditions are extremely strict. Once completed, it grants you the ability to &5delve into the world’s memories&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The casting conditions for &6Verdant Flow&r are as follows:"
				""
				"1. Obtain a &6rare treasure&r while mining coal."
				""
				"2. When using bone meal on grass blocks, encounter a &6flower that blooms in the darkness&r."
				""
				"3. While fishing during a rainy night, the &6rain suddenly stops&r."
				""
				"4. After all the above conditions are met, release the spell using a scroll."
			]
