		{
			dependencies: ["789A88270498ED92"]
			description: [
				"You may have already guessed it—after all, in the original Overworld, a similar &5ruin&r exists round the &2world origin&r, yet summoning the &2Wither Storm&r is always blocked by a mysterious force."
				""
				"However, in this dimension, that mysterious force seems to have lost its effect. By placing Wither Skeleton Skulls on top of the command block structure located at (0, 0), you can summon the &5Wither Storm&r."
				""
				"But the power of the &5Wither Storm&r is extraordinarily overwhelming. Combined with the various &5curses of this dimension&r, defeating it seems almost impossible."
				""
				"If you are playing on a server, &2please confirm with the host before attempting to summon the Wither Storm&r, as it may cause significant lag and performance issues. It is important to &2notify the server owner&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If the Wither Storm has already been defeated by other players on your server, you can summon it again in the Memory Dimension using the &6Summoning Altar&r."
			]
